            "name2": "char_201_moeshd_summer",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Utage",
        "text": "I don't see what's so fun about fighting."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_337_utage_summer_1#3",
            "name2": "char_201_moeshd_summer",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Croissant",
        "text": "...I heard you singin' a whole 'nother tune last time you was fightin', Utage."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_337_utage_summer_1",
            "name2": "char_201_moeshd_summer",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Utage",
        "text": "Ahahaha. I guess you're right."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Utage",
        "text": "Hey, Croissant, that isn't a swimsuit, is it?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_337_utage_summer_1",
            "name2": "char_201_moeshd_summer",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Croissant",
        "text": "Ahahaha, ya got me. It's just some outdoorsy getup I snagged. Plenty waterproof, so we'n pretend it's a swimsuit."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_337_utage_summer_1#2",
            "name2": "char_201_moeshd_summer",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Utage",
        "text": "You're a real function over form kinda girl, huh?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Utage",
        "text": "But hey, it may not be a beach, but playing around a waterfall is pretty great too! It's got that real 'back to nature' vibe. Too bad I didn't bring my camera."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_337_utage_summer_1#2",
            "name2": "char_201_moeshd_summer",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Croissant",
        "text": "Ya got that right. I ain't never been out in the wilds like this before. I'm havin' a ball!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_337_utage_summer_1#4",
            "name2": "char_201_moeshd_summer",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Utage",
        "text": "Hey..."
